UQ3IcHCJ4BKAk",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_SEATING_TYPE"],"可選擇哪些類型的座位？",null,[[[["E:DINING_SEATING_TYPE_INDOOR_DINING_AREA"],"室內用餐區",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwjfyrTL9dmWAxUjb_UHHZ22F0UQ3YcHCKEBKAA"]]],null,"座位類型",null,"0ahUKEwjfyrTL9dmWAxUjb_UHHZ22F0UQ3IcHCKABKAo",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["點了大蒜拳骨味增叉燒拉麵-$270\n拉麵的湯頭喝起來挺濃郁～\n微微的蒜香帶一點味增口感\n看似湯頭表面很油亮，但卻鹹而不膩👌\n\n至於麵條是正常的硬度\n咬下去微微的Q彈，但又沒有到很軟嫩的口感\n帶一點點嚼勁（我覺得啦～\n吸著濃郁的湯頭會讓人想一口接著一口～\n\n至於叉燒🐷個人覺得還可以～\n被煮到軟軟的，口感算不錯\n味道上跟湯頭的口感一致，並不會很突兀\n\n整體品嚐起來，濃郁的味道不會讓人覺得重到吃不下去\n只會在第一口帶給你驚喜感\n然後那些重口味感很快就會在口中消失\n還算是可以啦～是願意再回頭嘗試其他口味",null,[0,43]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/5695379790624833989/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnQwVjFReVdscFBWMlIzVm01a05sVXhPVzVTZWxwcFZWUlZlVlpHUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/5695379790624833989/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnQwVjFReVdscFBWMlIzVm01a05sVXhPVzVTZWxwcFZWUlZlVlpHUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/5695379790624833989/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnQwVjFReVdscFBWMlIzVm01a05sVXhPVzVTZWxwcFZWUlZlVlpHUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/5695379790624833989/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnQwVjFReVdscFBWMlIzVm01a05sVXhPVzVTZWxwcFZWUlZlVlpHUlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/5695379790624833989/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnQwVjFReVdscFBWMlIzVm01a05sVXhPVzVTZWxwcFZWUlZlVlpHUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/5695379790624833989/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnQwVjFReVdscFBWMlIzVm01a05sVXhPVzVTZWxwcFZWUlZlVlpHUlJBQhAA"]],[null,null,4084,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2t0V1QyWlpPV2R3Vm5kNlUxOW5SelppVVRVeVZGRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x2d4acd848b